# Build, publish, NuGet and test outputs
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Aa]rtifacts/
**/[Oo]ut/
**/[Pp]ublish/
**/[Pp]ackages/
**/TestResults/
**/test-results/
**/coverage/
**/coveragereport/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml

# Source-control, IDE and local runtime state
.agents/
.git/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.aspire/
.devcontainer/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userosscache
**/*.sln.docstates
